    "JSON olarak d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Exportera som JSON", // EN: Export as JSON
    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ingen lagrad historik \u00e4nnu;endast de senaste avl\u00e4sningarna exporteras.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "L\u00e4gg till en effektm\u00e4tare f\u00f6r att se verkliga v\u00e4rden h\u00e4r.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Direktavl\u00e4sning fr\u00e5n {0} uppm\u00e4tta enheter.", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Kunde inte l\u00e4sa m\u00e4tningar (enheter kan vara offline).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (varje kv\u00e4ll kl. 23.00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Aktiv (platsutl\u00f6sare kommer snart)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Den h\u00e4r strategin k\u00f6rs enligt ett schema: medan appen \u00e4r \u00f6ppen (i facket p\u00e5 skrivbordet) bryter den str\u00f6mmen till de utvalda energienheterna varje natt klockan 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Denna strategi bygger p\u00e5 platsutl\u00f6sare;automatisk platsutl\u00f6sning \u00e4r inte tillg\u00e4nglig \u00e4nnu.Om du aktiverar det sparas det, men det k\u00f6rs inte av sig sj\u00e4lvt.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Denna triggertyp k\u00f6rs inte automatiskt \u00e4nnu;n\u00e4r den har sparats k\u00f6rs den vid den tidpunkt du v\u00e4ljer nedan (schemalagd).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "En utl\u00f6sare f\u00f6r s\u00e4kerhetsl\u00e4ge kan inte st\u00e4llas in: appen har \u00e4nnu ingen l\u00e4sbar larmpaneltillst\u00e5nd eller NEXUS-niv\u00e5l\u00e4gesbrytare.Arbetstyper: Timer, v\u00e4der, enhetstillst\u00e5nd och larm utl\u00f6st (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Den h\u00e4r triggertypen st\u00f6ds inte \u00e4n, s\u00e5 den kan inte sparas.Arbetstyper: Timer, v\u00e4der, enhetstillst\u00e5nd och larm utl\u00f6st (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "V\u00e4derf\u00f6rh\u00e5llanden", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Verkliga v\u00e4derdata f\u00f6r din hemplats l\u00e4ses ungef\u00e4r var 10:e minut medan appen \u00e4r \u00f6ppen.Scenariot k\u00f6rs en g\u00e5ng n\u00e4r villkoret g\u00e5r fr\u00e5n inte uppfyllt till uppfyllt.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k (\u00b0C)": "Temperatur (\u00b0C)", // EN: Temperature (°C)
