    "Ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi, hava verisi okunamaz. \u00d6nce": "Ingen hemplats \u00e4r inst\u00e4lld, s\u00e5 v\u00e4dret kan inte avl\u00e4sas.F\u00f6rst", // EN: No home location is set, so weather can't be read. First
    "konum se\u00e7": "v\u00e4lj en plats", // EN: choose a location
