    "Hava durumu tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "V\u00e4derutl\u00f6sare: ingen hemplats inst\u00e4lld.", // EN: Weather trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetiklenince \u00c7al\u0131\u015facak Senaryo": "Scenario som ska k\u00f6ras n\u00e4r det utl\u00f6ses", // EN: Scenario to Run When Triggered
    "Yaln\u0131zca bildirim": "Endast avisering", // EN: Notification only
    "Zamanlamal\u0131 otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Schemalagda automatiseringar k\u00f6rs medan appen \u00e4r \u00f6ppen;p\u00e5 skrivbordet forts\u00e4tter de att k\u00f6ra medan appen ligger kvar i facket.", // EN: Scheduled automations run while the app is open; on desktop they keep running while the app stays in the tray.
    "Otomasyonlar uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 tepsideyken de zamanlamalar devam eder.": "Automatiseringar k\u00f6rs medan appen \u00e4r \u00f6ppen;p\u00e5 skrivbordet forts\u00e4tter scheman medan appen ligger kvar i facket.", // EN: Automations run while the app is open; on desktop, schedules continue while the app stays in the tray.
