    "{0} cihaz g\u00fcncellendi.": "{0} enhet(er) har uppdaterats.", // EN: {0} device(s) updated.
    "tetiklendi; tan\u0131ml\u0131 eylem yok (Senaryo Ayarlar\u0131'ndan bir senaryo se\u00e7ebilirsin).": "utl\u00f6st;ingen \u00e5tg\u00e4rd definierad (v\u00e4lj ett scenario fr\u00e5n Scenarioinst\u00e4llningar).", // EN: triggered; no action defined (pick a scenario from Scenario Settings).
    "{0} cihaz\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fc kesildi.": "str\u00f6mavbrott till {0} enhet(er).", // EN: power cut to {0} device(s).
    "Gece stratejisi tetiklendi; se\u00e7ili enerji cihaz\u0131 yok.": "Nattstrategi utl\u00f6st;inga valda energienheter.", // EN: Night strategy triggered; no selected energy devices.
    "Enerji stratejisi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131": "Energistrategin l\u00f6pte", // EN: Energy strategy ran
    "G\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131 tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Solnedg\u00e5ngstrigger: ingen hemplats inst\u00e4lld.", // EN: Sunset trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetikleme saati ka\u00e7\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (uygulama kapal\u0131yd\u0131).": "Utl\u00f6sningstid missad (appen st\u00e4ngdes).", // EN: Trigger time missed (the app was closed).
    "Kameralar": "Kameror", // EN: Cameras
    "Kamera Cihazlar\u0131m": "Mina kameror", // EN: My Cameras
    "Kamera ekleyince durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 buradan izlersin. Video ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 (RTSP) deste\u011fi yak\u0131nda.": "L\u00e4gg till en kamera f\u00f6r att \u00f6vervaka dess status och sekretessinst\u00e4llningar h\u00e4r.St\u00f6d f\u00f6r videostr\u00f6mning (RTSP) kommer snart.", // EN: Add a camera to monitor its status and privacy setting here. Video streaming (RTSP) support is coming soon.
    "Kamera Ekle": "L\u00e4gg till kamera", // EN: Add Camera
    "Bu ekranda kamera cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n ger\u00e7ek durumu listelenir. Canl\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 i\u00e7in cihaz\u0131n\u0131n kendi uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Den h\u00e4r sk\u00e4rmen visar den verkliga statusen f\u00f6r dina kameraenheter.F\u00f6r livevideo anv\u00e4nder du kamerans egen app.", // EN: This screen lists the real status of your camera devices. For live video, use your camera's own app.
    "G\u0130ZL\u0130L\u0130K MODU": "SEKRETESSL\u00c4GE", // EN: PRIVACY MODE
    "Yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fc yok": "Ingen inbyggd bro", // EN: No built-in bridge
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcd\u00fcr: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS styr dina enheter direkt fr\u00e5n sin egen app;den inneh\u00e5ller inte en HomeKit-brygga.F\u00f6r att anv\u00e4nda dem med Apple Home (HomeKit) \u00e4r den praktiska v\u00e4gen Home Assistant-bryggan: l\u00e4gg till dina enheter i Home Assistant och aktivera sedan HA:s HomeKit-integration.", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app; it does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is the Home Assistant bridge: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "Home Assistant K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc A\u00e7": "\u00d6ppna Home Assistant Bridge", // EN: Open Home Assistant Bridge
    "HomeKit ile Kullanma": "Anv\u00e4nds med HomeKit", // EN: Using with HomeKit
    "Masa\u00fcst\u00fc HomeKit K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc": "Desktop HomeKit Bridge", // EN: Desktop HomeKit Bridge
    "masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde": "p\u00e5 skrivbordet,", // EN: on desktop,
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir;": "NEXUS styr dina enheter direkt fr\u00e5n sin egen app;", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app;
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Durdur": "Stop Bridge", // EN: Stop Bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor": "Bro springer", // EN: Bridge running
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor": "Bridge otillg\u00e4nglig", // EN: Bridge unavailable
    "HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc bu kurulumda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor (kit/bridge.cjs y\u00fcklenemedi) \u2014 Apple Ev i\u00e7in Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc \u00f6neririz.": "HomeKit-bryggan \u00e4r inte tillg\u00e4nglig i den h\u00e4r installationen (kit/bridge.cjs kunde inte laddas) \u2014 f\u00f6r Apple Home rekommenderar vi Home Assistant-bryggan.", // EN: The HomeKit bridge isn't available in this install (kit/bridge.cjs could not be loaded) — for Apple Home we recommend the Home Assistant bridge.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor \u00b7 port {0} \u00b7 {1} cihaz": "K\u00f6r \u00b7 port {0} \u00b7 {1} enheter", // EN: Running · port {0} · {1} devices
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. E\u015fle\u015fme kal\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p tepside bekledik\u00e7e ev uygulamas\u0131ndaki anahtarlar ger\u00e7ek cihaza gider.": "Bryggan m\u00e5ste vara p\u00e5 samma Wi-Fi som din iOS-enhet.Parning kvarst\u00e5r;s\u00e5 l\u00e4nge NEXUS forts\u00e4tter att k\u00f6ras i facket, g\u00e5r omkopplarna i Home-appen till den riktiga enheten.", // EN: The bridge must be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. Pairing persists; as long as NEXUS stays running in the tray, switches in the Home app go to the real device.
    "Hesab\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131 kay\u0131tlar": "L\u00e4nkad till ditt konto", // EN: Linked to your account
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcler ve a\u00e7\u0131k kaynak": "Broar och \u00f6ppen k\u00e4llkod", // EN: Bridges and open source
    "Bu yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131ran cihazlar a\u011fda otomatik bulunur.": "Enheter som k\u00f6r denna programvara hittas automatiskt p\u00e5 n\u00e4tverket.", // EN: Devices running this software are found automatically on the network.
    "HomeKit ve Apple Ev, Apple Inc. tescilli markalar\u0131d\u0131r. Bu ad\u0131mlar telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc i\u00e7indir: cihaz kontrol\u00fc Home Assistant \u00fczerinden iletilir. Masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde NEXUS kendi yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc yay\u0131nlar (yukar\u0131daki panel).": "HomeKit och Apple Home \u00e4r varum\u00e4rken som tillh\u00f6r Apple Inc. Dessa steg \u00e4r f\u00f6r telefon-/webbversionen: enhetskontroll vidarebefordras via Home Assistant.P\u00e5 skrivbordet publicerar NEXUS sin egen inbyggda brygga (panelen ovan).", // EN: HomeKit and Apple Home are trademarks of Apple Inc. These steps are for the phone/web version: device control is relayed via Home Assistant. On desktop, NEXUS publishes its own built-in bridge (the panel above).
    "Payla\u015f\u0131lacak cihaz yok: yerel a\u011fda anahtar yetene\u011fi olan cihaz laz\u0131m": "Inga enheter att dela: en enhet med v\u00e4xlingsf\u00f6rm\u00e5ga p\u00e5 ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk kr\u00e4vs", // EN: No devices to share: a device with the switch capability on your local network is required
