    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "G\u00e5 med i ett hem", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e4r en enhet sl\u00e5s p\u00e5 eller av", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Tryck p\u00e5 en enhet f\u00f6r att \u00f6ppna panelens kontrollsk\u00e4rm;den visar bara de funktioner som enheten st\u00f6der.F\u00f6r Shelly-, WLED- och ESPHome-enheter g\u00e5r p\u00e5/av och ljusstyrka direkt till enheten.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Den h\u00e4r koden anv\u00e4nds p\u00e5 sk\u00e4rmen G\u00e5 med i en startsida.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
