    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Denna 8-siffriga kod \u00e4r f\u00f6r Apple HomeKit-parning och fungerar endast med Apple Home-appen.Om enheten st\u00f6der ett lokalt API som Shelly, WLED eller Tasmota kan du l\u00e4gga till det fr\u00e5n ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Denna enhet", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Denna QR-kod tillh\u00f6r ett Wi-Fi-n\u00e4tverk, inte en enhet.N\u00e4r du har anslutit enheten till samma n\u00e4tverk kan du l\u00e4gga till den fr\u00e5n ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ingen k\u00e4nd NEXUS-enhet hittades p\u00e5 den h\u00e4r adressen.Se till att enheten \u00e4r p\u00e5 och p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Skapa denna smarta app:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "F\u00f6rbereder f\u00f6reslagna funktioner f\u00f6r detta fl\u00f6de.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Sparad denna m\u00e5nad", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Ingen enhet som st\u00f6ds hittades p\u00e5 detta n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Ingen enhet som st\u00f6ds hittades p\u00e5 detta n\u00e4tverk.Se till att enheten \u00e4r p\u00e5 och ansluten till samma Wi-Fi;anv\u00e4nd annars katalogen nedan eller en QR/inst\u00e4llningskod.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lokalt skydd f\u00f6r denna enhet", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Den h\u00e4r enheten delar inte versionsinformation", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Den h\u00e4r enheten eller anslutningen st\u00f6der inte ficklampan.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Den h\u00e4r enheten st\u00f6der inte automatisk plats.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Den h\u00e4r inbjudningskoden hittades inte.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Den h\u00e4r sk\u00e4rmen grupperar belysningsenheterna du har lagt till efter rum;n\u00e4r du sparar en scen st\u00e4lls ljusstyrka och ton in tillsammans.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Enheter som du l\u00e4gger till i det h\u00e4r hemmet listas h\u00e4r.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Enheter som du l\u00e4gger till i det h\u00e4r hemmet listas h\u00e4r och l\u00e4nkade till dina favoritkort.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "\u00c4r du s\u00e4ker p\u00e5 att du vill ta bort det h\u00e4r hemmet och alla dess inst\u00e4llningar permanent?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Den h\u00e4r koden \u00e4r inte en enhetskod som st\u00f6ds.Om du k\u00e4nner till enhetens IP-adress kan du l\u00e4gga till den fr\u00e5n ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Dessa varum\u00e4rken styrs \u00f6ver ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Denna mini-app tillhandah\u00e5lls av den officiella leverant\u00f6ren.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Den h\u00e4r milj\u00f6n st\u00f6der inte kamera\u00e5tkomst.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "N\u00e4tverksskanning \u00e4r inte tillg\u00e4nglig h\u00e4r.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
