    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Ange enhetens IP-adress och NEXUS tar reda p\u00e5 vilket protokoll den talar.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Kontrollera enhetens Wi-Fi-anslutning och din router.Om problemet kvarst\u00e5r, ta bort enheten och l\u00e4gg till den igen.Steg: Enheter > v\u00e4lj enheten > Ta bort.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Kontrollera enhetens Wi-Fi-anslutning och din router.Om problemet kvarst\u00e5r tar du bort enheten fr\u00e5n NEXUS-appen och l\u00e4gger till den igen.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Om din enhet inte dyker upp anv\u00e4nder du QR-skanning eller en inst\u00e4llningskod.Du kan \u00f6ppna hj\u00e4lpsidan f\u00f6r st\u00f6d och v\u00e4gledning.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Din enhets platstj\u00e4nst (GPS) \u00e4r avst\u00e4ngd.Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 den och f\u00f6rs\u00f6k igen.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
