    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "St\u00e4ng av alla belysningsgrupper som finns kvar hemma.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Hemma och Borta", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Borta", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "N\u00e4r du \u00e4r borta", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Hantera belysningen i ditt hem rum f\u00f6r rum i ett fl\u00f6de.P\u00e5/av, ljusstyrka, f\u00e4rgtemperatur och snabba scengenv\u00e4gar i en app.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Ge f\u00e4rdiga kommandon, snabba automatiseringar och smarta appf\u00f6rslag baserat p\u00e5 enheterna hemma.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Skapa en klimatkomfortapp som hanterar AC och termostater i ditt hem fr\u00e5n en panel.Inkludera temperaturkontroll, snabbl\u00e4gen, ekol\u00e4ge och rumsbaserade \u00e5tg\u00e4rder.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Vad \u00e4r statusen f\u00f6r mina enheter?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
