    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Bort fr\u00e5n hemmascenen", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Avslutar energi- och s\u00e4kerhetskontroller n\u00e4r du g\u00e5r hemifr\u00e5n.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
