    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Avsluta l\u00e4mna hemmet", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Skapa en check-app f\u00f6r att l\u00e4mna hemmet som visar enheter som \u00e4r kvar p\u00e5, l\u00e5sstatus och energiinst\u00e4llningar p\u00e5 en sk\u00e4rm.L\u00e4gg till snabbavst\u00e4ngnings- och s\u00e4kerhetsaktiveringsknappar.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Kontrollera enheter som \u00e4r kvar p\u00e5, l\u00e5s och energistatus i ett fl\u00f6de n\u00e4r du l\u00e4mnar hemmet.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Visa enheter som \u00e4r p\u00e5, l\u00e5s och energistatus p\u00e5 en sk\u00e4rm n\u00e4r du l\u00e4mnar hemmet.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Se lampor, kontakter, AC och s\u00e4kerhetsinst\u00e4llningar som \u00e4r t\u00e4nda innan du l\u00e4mnar hemmet, p\u00e5 en panel.Samla snabba avst\u00e4ngnings- och s\u00e4kerhetsaktiveringssteg i ett fl\u00f6de.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "L\u00e5t oss g\u00f6ra de sista kontrollerna innan du \u00e5ker.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "St\u00e4ng av ljuset automatiskt efter avresa...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "St\u00e4ng av belysningen automatiskt efter att ha l\u00e4mnat hemmet", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "St\u00e4ng av lamporna automatiskt n\u00e4r du l\u00e4mnar och t\u00e4nd dem n\u00e4r du kommer tillbaka.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "St\u00e4ng av luftkonditioneringen automatiskt n\u00e4r ingen \u00e4r hemma och undvik on\u00f6dig konsumtion.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Sl\u00e5 automatiskt av str\u00f6mmen till enheter i standby vid den tid du v\u00e4ljer p\u00e5 natten.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e4r man g\u00e5r hemifr\u00e5n", // EN: When leaving home
