    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc": "Bridge version", // EN: Bridge Version
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Bryggan m\u00e5ste vara p\u00e5 samma Wi-Fi som din iOS-enhet.Parningen f\u00f6rblir giltig s\u00e5 l\u00e4nge din dator f\u00f6rblir aktiv (fack/bakgrundsdrift st\u00f6ds).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Starta bron", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Tryck p\u00e5 den runda knappen p\u00e5 bryggan och f\u00f6rs\u00f6k sedan igen.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Tryck p\u00e5 den runda knappen p\u00e5 toppen av bron och tryck sedan p\u00e5 \"Anslut bro\" inom 30 sekunder.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Det gick inte att ansluta till bron.Se till att du \u00e4r p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk och f\u00f6rs\u00f6k igen.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
