    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Att l\u00e4gga till Matter-enheter beh\u00f6ver en Matter-kontroller, vilket NEXUS inte erbjuder \u00e4nnu.Om enheten ansluter via Wi-Fi kan du l\u00e4gga till den fr\u00e5n ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk genom dess IP-adress.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
