    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS \u00e4r lokalt f\u00f6rst: din enhetsdata stannar p\u00e5 den h\u00e4r enheten, enhetskommandon g\u00e5r direkt \u00f6ver ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk och ingenting delas med tredje part.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
