    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Parningskoden \u00e4r inte giltig.Ange den 11-siffriga koden eller QR-inneh\u00e5llet som b\u00f6rjar med MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Ange den h\u00e4r koden i NEXUS-skrivbordsappen.Om enheten \u00e4r p\u00e5 Wi-Fi kan du ocks\u00e5 l\u00e4gga till den fr\u00e5n ditt lokala n\u00e4tverk genom dess IP-adress.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Enheten s\u00f6ks efter p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk och paras ihop.Detta kan ta upp till en minut;enheten m\u00e5ste vara p\u00e5 och i parningsl\u00e4ge.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Enheten hittades inte eller kunde inte paras.Se till att den \u00e4r p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk, p\u00e5slagen och i parningsl\u00e4ge.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Enheten hittades inte.Se till att den \u00e4r p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk, p\u00e5slagen och i parningsl\u00e4ge.Din dators brandv\u00e4gg kan blockera svar fr\u00e5n enheter i det lokala n\u00e4tverket.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Enheten kunde inte paras.Kontrollera kopplingskoden och att enheten \u00e4r i kopplingsl\u00e4ge.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Enheten \u00e4r ihopparad men har ingen funktion som NEXUS kan styra.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Enheten svarade inte.Se till att den \u00e4r p\u00e5 och p\u00e5 samma n\u00e4tverk.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
