    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "En-trycks underh\u00e5llningspanel f\u00f6r TV-apparater och mediaenheter.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
