    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Naturligtvis!Jag kan s\u00e4tta ihop ett bra smart scenario \u00e5t dig.Kan du ge mig n\u00e5gra detaljer?Till exempel: \"Starta kaffemaskinen n\u00e4r jag vaknar\" eller \"D\u00e4mpa ljuset helt n\u00e4r jag tittar p\u00e5 en film\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
