    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "\u00d6ppna den h\u00e4r sk\u00e4rmen i NEXUS-appen p\u00e5 din iPhone;dina scener listas nedan och du kan st\u00e4lla in en Siri-genv\u00e4g f\u00f6r var och en.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Kopiera scenl\u00e4nken", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Den h\u00e4r l\u00e4nken \u00f6ppnar NEXUS och k\u00f6r scenen direkt.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
