    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e4r en d\u00f6rr/f\u00f6nstersensor \u00f6ppnas", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "N\u00e4r en r\u00f6k-, \u00f6versv\u00e4mnings- eller gassensor larmar", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Enhets- och sensorutl\u00f6sare visas h\u00e4r n\u00e4r du l\u00e4gger till en l\u00e4mplig enhet.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
