    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "T\u00e4nder varje ljus med full ljusstyrka.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Sl\u00e4cker varje ljus.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "T\u00e4nder lampor med full ljusstyrka i dagsljus.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "St\u00e4ller in belysningen p\u00e5 85 % i en neutral ton och st\u00e4nger av TV:n.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "St\u00e4ller in ljuset p\u00e5 40 % i en varm ton.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Varje kv\u00e4ll 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
