    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "St\u00e4ller in termostaten p\u00e5 24\u00b0 komfortinst\u00e4llning.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Vardagar 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
