    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "St\u00e4nger varje gardin och persienn.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Varje dag vid solnedg\u00e5ngen", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "L\u00e5ser alla smarta l\u00e5s (l\u00e5s l\u00e5ses aldrig upp).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "St\u00e4nger av lamporna och TV:n;l\u00e4mnar pluggar och AC ensam.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 eller av en enhet", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Skickar ett kommando till den enhet du v\u00e4ljer.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Vilken enhet?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "St\u00e4ng av", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "V\u00e4lj den enhet som ska styras.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Se luftkvaliteten, temperaturen och luftfuktigheten som dina sensorer m\u00e4ter och kontrollera din renare.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "G\u00f6r ljus, gardiner och AC redo f\u00f6r dagen med ett tryck.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 ljus, gardiner och klimat tillsammans n\u00e4r du kommer hem.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "S\u00e4tt dina enheter i ett s\u00e4kert, energibesparande tillst\u00e5nd medan du \u00e4r borta l\u00e4nge.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "D\u00e4mpa belysningen, st\u00e4ng gardinerna och s\u00e4tt p\u00e5 TV:n.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Starta din robotdammsugare eller skicka tillbaka den till bryggan.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "L\u00e5s d\u00f6rren, st\u00e4ng gardinerna och g\u00f6r huset klart f\u00f6r natten.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Se status och sekretessinst\u00e4llningar f\u00f6r dina kameror p\u00e5 en sk\u00e4rm.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Sl\u00e5 p\u00e5 eller av sekretessl\u00e4get f\u00f6r dina kameror fr\u00e5n ett st\u00e4lle n\u00e4r du \u00e4r hemma.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Se vilken automation som k\u00f6rs n\u00e4r idag.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Dela anteckningar och att g\u00f6ra med ditt hush\u00e5ll.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Se ditt hems h\u00e4lsosammanfattning fr\u00e5n luften, luftfuktigheten och temperaturen som dina sensorer m\u00e4ter.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
