    "Evcil hayvan kontrol paneli \u00b7 besleme, takip": "Kontrollpanel f\u00f6r husdjur \u00b7 utfodring, sp\u00e5rning", // EN: Pet control panel · feeding, tracking
    "Bebek \u00fcr\u00fcnleri paneli \u00b7 izleme ve uyar\u0131lar": "Babyprodukter panel \u00b7 \u00f6vervakning och varningar", // EN: Baby products panel · monitoring and alerts
