    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Detta namn visas p\u00e5 hemkortet och i enhetslistan.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
    "Cihaz ad\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Byt namn p\u00e5 enheten", // EN: Rename device
    "\u015eifre Belirle": "Ange ett l\u00f6senord", // EN: Set a password
    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "Detta konto har inget l\u00f6senord \u00e4n", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Ditt l\u00f6senord \u00e4r inst\u00e4llt \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Det h\u00e4r kontot har \u00f6ppnats med Google och har inget l\u00f6senord \u00e4n.Ange ditt f\u00f6rsta l\u00f6senord h\u00e4r;efter det kan du ocks\u00e5 logga in med e-post och l\u00f6senord.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Maila mig en l\u00e4nk f\u00f6r l\u00f6senordsinst\u00e4llningar", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Den h\u00e4r \u00e5tg\u00e4rden beh\u00f6ver extra verifiering.Du kan beg\u00e4ra en l\u00e4nk f\u00f6r l\u00f6senordsinst\u00e4llningar nedan.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "L\u00f6senordsinstallationsl\u00e4nk skickas till din inkorg \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "L\u00f6senordsl\u00e4nken kan inte skickas just nu.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Vi kunde inte hitta din e-postadress f\u00f6r inloggning.logga in f\u00f6rst.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "L\u00e4nken kunde inte skickas.F\u00f6rs\u00f6k igen om ett \u00f6gonblick.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
