    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Inga m\u00e4tningar registrerade \u00e4nnu.L\u00e4gg till en enhet som m\u00e4ter effekt och \u00f6ppna den h\u00e4r sidan;l\u00e4sningar kommer att byggas upp h\u00e4r.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Intervaller utan m\u00e4tningar r\u00e4knas inte, s\u00e5 v\u00e4rdena kan vara l\u00e4gre \u00e4n den faktiska f\u00f6rbrukningen.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
