    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ange koden fr\u00e5n e-postinbjudan.Koden \u00e4r f\u00f6r eng\u00e5ngsbruk och fungerar endast med den inbjudna e-postadressen.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Inloggning kr\u00e4vs", // EN: Sign-in required
