    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "E-postmeddelandet kunde inte skickas fr\u00e5n servern", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Inbjudan skapades men det automatiska e-postmeddelandet kunde inte skickas.Ska vi f\u00f6rbereda inbjudningstexten med din egen mailapp?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
